  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1278492/description_0f40073b-6e77-41a4-8b64-a931e5d137c7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"825\" height=\"345\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pC8HxhTPK3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b3523cedf0cb3f3c12740f07400b5bc306954b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fvesmaybevesper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a0c2971228a3266c56e4dcdeef1229af0974192.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fgentler-weather-sounds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/GB2EXKpD?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=276538\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1278492?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=orange\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1278492/description_5745a5e2-f5f3-4085-8ee2-1a40cb5e877e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"164\" height=\"33\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我從來對 Minecraft 的天氣音效感到不滿意，覺得它們要不就是刺耳、要不就是格格不入，聽起來也沒什麼樂趣，所以我製作了「Gentler Weather Sounds」！「Gentler Weather Sounds」將 Minecraft 的天氣音效替換為更悅耳的音頻。它會替換下雨和雷聲的音效！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-weather-radius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended Weather Radius</a> 使用！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">若只想單獨更換下雨音效或閃電與雷聲音效，請分別使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/gentler-rain-sounds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gentler Rain Sounds</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-lightning-sounds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Lightning Sounds</a> ！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3146\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9280455e1c94978a408dde3d6785bce2a4503d_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"300\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1278492/description_ec83526f-3658-4f48-b125-eee7e139085e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"33\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入內容已移除： <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fKZ7cHgVvkzE%3fsi%3ddEjtzLAtv_gK0Jby\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/KZ7cHgVvkzE?si=dEjtzLAtv_gK0Jby</a> </span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>預覽錄影於 2.2.0 版本錄製</em></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1278492/description_0f519ff1-efc3-4650-b9be-b530330bc4f7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"98\" height=\"33\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>我可以在整合包或伺服器上使用這個模組嗎？</strong></p>\n<p>可以，請盡可能將更多人從可怕的原版下雨音效中拯救出來吧！</p>\n<p><strong>你會支援第三方模組的天氣音效嗎？</strong></p>\n<p>我持開放態度，但該模組必須有讓我覺得煩人的預設音效。目前我不會為了替換而替換。你可以在我的 Discord 伺服器留下你的請求。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1278492/description_c79182e2-ef53-4b86-9cc9-a926933777cb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"33\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>任何未標註出處的音效均由我設計／錄製</p>\n<p>所有音效都已進行編輯，以確保彼此搭配更為和諧</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252frain-and-thunder-nature-sounds-7803%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/rain-and-thunder-nature-sounds-7803/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fsoft-rain-ambient-111154%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/soft-rain-ambient-111154/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fnatural-thunder-113219%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/natural-thunder-113219/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fbone666138%252fsounds%252f198857%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/bone666138/sounds/198857/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fthunder-24571%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/thunder-24571/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fshelbyshark%252fsounds%252f513394%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/shelbyshark/sounds/513394/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fcopyright-free-rain-sounds-331497%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/copyright-free-rain-sounds-331497/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fSoundrack%252fsounds%252f733288%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/Soundrack/sounds/733288/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fSpennnyyy%252fsounds%252f350506%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/Spennnyyy/sounds/350506/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fjrosin%252fsounds%252f329978%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/jrosin/sounds/329978/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fdobroide%252fsounds%252f41365%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/dobroide/sounds/41365/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252ffattirewhitey%252fsounds%252f523905%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/fattirewhitey/sounds/523905/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fcalm-rain-ambience-421001\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/calm-rain-ambience-421001</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>",
